{"brief":"The user enjoys comedy because it makes them laugh and usually does not need a sensible plot. They described one favorite comedy as funny overall, but its title was inaudible and remains unknown.

They have seen Stepbrothers and liked the pairing of the lead actors, Will Ferrell and the other lead, whose name they could not recall. They felt the actors were a good combination and cited that as their reason for liking it.

They dislike drama, saying they already have enough drama in their own life and do not enjoy thinking about other people’s problems. They referred to the clichéd problems in dramas, though their qualification involving “not superficial” was unclear. They could not name a specific movie they strongly disliked at the time."}
